<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA 317-7 AT CLOSE IN SECOND TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA 317-7 AT CLOSE IN SECOND TEST.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka were 317 for seven wickets at the close of play in reply to Zimbabwe's first innings total of 141 on the second day of the second cricket test on Thursday.</p>
</text>
